  user_1,It's HP-001234
  user_2,Thank you Neha I've checked and yes your policy HP-001234 was cancelled effective immediately
  user_1,Okay that's what I thought But I just got a bill in the mail today
  user_2,I apologize for the confusion Let me see what's going on [typing] Ah I see the issue The bill was generated before the cancellation was processed But don't worry you won't have to pay it
